#* {{quote-book|en|year=2011|title=Savoring the Past: The French Kitchen and Table from 1300 to 1789|author=w:Barbara Ketcham Wheaton|page=102|passage=The staff for both ''cuisine'' and ''office'' were hired and fired by the '''maître d'hôtel'''.}}

